{"D:\\wt\\ssimple5\\vlog\\ssimple5\\voz\\b000_t4.wav": {"text": "This is my mother's furoshiki, a square of blue cotton cloth she carried for 60 years. With this one cloth, she never needed a shopping bag, a gift box, or a roll of wrapping paper. She lived to 101 in Osaka. After 60, she stopped buying nine things, one by one, and she never missed any of them. Today, I will tell you all nine, and number nine is the one that kept her comfortable for 40 years, on a very small pension, when many of her friends were worried every month. One of them she replaced with a big kettle and a handful of roasted barley. Another one she replaced with a square of old cotton cut from my father's shirts. But first, one honest thing. This is not advice from a bank, and I am not telling you how to spend your money. This is just how one old woman in Osaka lived. simple and happy and I am 79 now and I do every one of these nine things", "words": [{"w": " This", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.3}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.5}, {"w": " my", "s": 0.5, "e": 0.62}, {"w": " mother's", "s": 0.62, "e": 1.2}, {"w": " furoshiki,", "s": 1.2, "e": 1.86}, {"w": " a", "s": 1.86, "e": 2.48}, {"w": " square", "s": 2.48, "e": 2.9}, {"w": " of", "s": 2.9, "e": 3.16}, {"w": " blue", "s": 3.16, "e": 3.44}, {"w": " cotton", "s": 3.44, "e": 3.82}, {"w": " cloth", "s": 3.82, "e": 4.3}, {"w": " she", "s": 4.3, "e": 4.58}, {"w": " carried", "s": 4.58, "e": 4.94}, {"w": " for", "s": 4.94, "e": 5.18}, {"w": " 60", "s": 5.18, "e": 5.64}, {"w": " years.", "s": 5.64, "e": 6.58}, {"w": " With", "s": 6.74, "e": 6.88}, {"w": " this", "s": 6.88, "e": 7.12}, {"w": " one", "s": 7.12, "e": 7.46}, {"w": " cloth,", "s": 7.46, "e": 8.06}, {"w": " she", "s": 8.06, "e": 8.16}, {"w": " never", "s": 8.16, "e": 8.54}, {"w": " needed", "s": 8.54, "e": 8.86}, {"w": " a", "s": 8.86, "e": 9.02}, {"w": " shopping", "s": 9.02, "e": 9.4}, {"w": " bag,", "s": 9.4, "e": 10.14}, {"w": " a", "s": 10.14, "e": 10.22}, {"w": " gift", "s": 10.22, "e": 10.62